+# Smartfill fork: modification notice
+
+This checkout is a **modified version** of the Bitwarden browser extension
+(`bitwarden/clients`, `apps/browser`, tag `browser-v2026.10.2`), changed on 2026-11-14 for
+personal use. It is not an official Bitwarden build and is not affiliated with or endorsed by
+Bitwarden Inc. The original license notices (`LICENSE.txt`, `LICENSE_GPL.txt`,
+`LICENSE_BITWARDEN.txt`) are unchanged; the changes below are released under the same GPL-3.0
+terms. Do not publish this build to an extension store.
+
+## What was changed
+
+All new code lives in `src/autofill/smartfill/`; upstream files are touched as little as possible
+and every change there is marked with a `Smartfill fork:` comment.
+
+| Area                                                               | Change                                                                                                                                                                                          |
+| ------------------------------------------------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
+| `src/autofill/smartfill/smartfill-recipe-format.ts`                | The `grokbot:recipe` format: parsing, validation, values (`username`, `password`, `totp`, `field:<name>`, `text:<words>`).                                                                      |
+| `src/autofill/smartfill/smartfill-field-matching.ts`               | Matching a login's extra custom fields to page controls (case- and accent-insensitive, exact before partial, ties left empty).                                                                  |
+| `src/autofill/smartfill/smartfill-recipe-runner.ts`                | Content script: runs the steps in a frame (fill, click, wait, keypad, press), reports progress, shows a notice on errors.                                                                       |
+| `src/autofill/smartfill/smartfill-recipe.background.ts`            | Background: decides when a recipe runs, resolves values, picks the frame, resumes after a page load only if the page is still on the login's site.                                              |
+| `src/autofill/services/autofill.service.ts`                        | `doAutoFill` hands logins with a recipe to the recipe runner; a login's plain-named custom fields use the shared matching rules; the recipe field is never typed into a page.                   |
+| `src/autofill/background/autofill-orchestrator.ts`                 | Recipes never run on page-load fills; frames without form fields are kept for logins with a recipe.                                                                                             |
+| `src/autofill/content/autofill-init.ts`                            | Message handlers for the recipe runner.                                                                                                                                                         |
+| `src/autofill/services/insert-autofill-content.service.ts`         | Drop-downs take the option whose value or text matches; `oui` / `on` tick a checkbox; a public fill-one-element method.                                                                         |
+| `src/autofill/services/collect-autofill-content.service.ts`        | Collects the text of `aria-labelledby` targets as a label.                                                                                                                                      |
+| `src/background/main.background.ts`                                | Creates and starts the recipe background.                                                                                                                                                       |
+| `webpack/manifest.js`, `webpack/manifest-smartfill-overrides.json` | The build is named "Bitwarden Smartfill (unofficial fork)" and uses its own Firefox add-on id, so it cannot replace the official add-on. `SMARTFILL_BRANDING=off` builds with upstream's names. |
+
+The format is shared with the Grok Bot Bitwarden connector; its specification is
+`docs/recipes.md`.
+
+## Behaviour that differs from upstream
+
+- A login's custom field with a plain name ("Numéro fiscal") is typed into **one** control, the
+  best label match, and never into a password box; upstream typed it into every control whose id,
+  name, label or neighbouring text equalled the name. Names in Bitwarden's rule syntax (`id=…`,
+  `name=…`, `label=…`, `placeholder=…`, `regex=…`, `csv=…`) and linked fields behave as upstream.
+  Cards and identities are untouched.
+- A login with a `grokbot:recipe` field is filled by its recipe on its own site, and is not
+  filled at all by "autofill on page load".
+- The recipe of a shared (organization) login is ignored and the login is filled the regular way:
+  anyone who can edit a shared login could otherwise make the browser click things on that site
+  (`SMARTFILL_RUN_ORGANIZATION_RECIPES` in `smartfill-recipe.background.ts`).
+- TOTP in a recipe follows the same entitlement as upstream's TOTP fill (Premium, or an
+  organization that uses TOTP).
+
+## Tests
+
+`npx jest src/autofill/smartfill` from `apps/browser` (52 unit tests). End-to-end tests with a
+local fake vault live outside this checkout, in `clients/extension/test` in the Taviri repository.
